   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "** DELIVERY: 5 months ** Movement: Two Sellita SW100 7 ¾” automatic movements, 25 jewels, Elaboré finish, adjusted 3 positions, 28,800 A/h. (4 Hz), Nivatronic coil, Incabloc anti-shock; power reserve approximately 42 hours. The two movements are mounted in a single support. Functions: Movement with display at 9 o'clock on the dial: local time with hour and minute hands on a 180° double scale; movement with display at 3 o'clock on the dial: world time, with disc indication and reading window, double 12-hour scale and quarter hour indication. Dual time function: universal time is completely independent of local time and allows you to also count locations with differences other than the time. Case: In AISI316 Plus stainless steel with polished, satin and blasted parts, diameter mm. 44.40, thickness 12.90 mm, strap mm. 24. Bezel fixed by interference, case back, screwed closed. Sapphire glass top and bottom. Double crown of exclusive design, with engraved logo. World time crown at 3 o'clock, with protection screwed to the case and tilting safety lever; crown at 8 o'clock for local time, in a protected position. Water resistance : 10ATM. Dial : Large in size, composed of nine different elements superimposed on 6 levels of thickness, with distinct hour markers for the two independent displays. The table of the time difference of the time zones, conventionally indicated with the names of a representative city, in reference to the GMT time, is printed on the outer ring which represents the highest level of the dial; The main constituent parts of the dial (back, main cover, world time cover and external ring) have different finishes and treatments. External fixing screws in stainless steel. Spheres of exclusive design. Strap: Leather with stainless steel buckle. Strap : Leather with stainless steel buckle. SPECS ¬ DIAMETER: 44.40mm ¬ THICKNESS: 12.90 mm, strap mm. 24. ¬ CASE: AISI316 Plus stainless steel with polished, satin and blasted parts. ¬ CROWN: Double crown of exclusive design, with engraved logo ¬ GLASS: Top and bottom Sapphire glass. ¬ MOVEMENT: 2 Sellita SW100 7 ¾” automatic movements, 25 jewels, Elaboré finish and adjusted 3 positions. Power reserve approximately 42 hours. The two movements are mounted in a single support. ¬ CASEBACK: Brushed AISI 316L stainless steel with engraved logo ¬ STRAP: Italian leather with stainless steel buckle. ¬ HANDS: Superluminova ¬ WATER RESISTANCE: 10 ATM / 100 m",
